  [1 ▤ Stacks]  2 ▣ Stack detail   3 ▶ Runs   4 ⚙ Settings   5 ▦ Containers   6 ◈ Proposals   7 ◎ System                
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  The deploy service is not set up yet. It rolls out and updates your stacks and runs as its own system user, apart from
  the host service, with access to Docker. G sets it up; on the command line: sudo qhost deploy-service setup           
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                            ╔═ Deploy service ═════════════════════════════════════════════╗                            
                            ║ ⚠ Set up the deploy service now?                             ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ It creates its channel and its unit and starts the service   ║                            
                            ║ as root, locked down by systemd to the stack folders and its ║                            
                            ║ own state. The host service gets no access to Docker. These  ║                            
                            ║ steps run as root:                                           ║                            
                            ║ $ write /etc/tmpfiles.d/qhost-deploy.conf (mode 0644): d     ║                            
                            ║   /run/qhost-deploy 2750 root qhost -                        ║                            
                            ║ $ systemd-tmpfiles --create                                  ║                            
                            ║   /etc/tmpfiles.d/qhost-deploy.conf                          ║                            
                            ║ $ systemctl enable --now qhost-deploy                        ║                            
                            ║ $ sudo qhost deploy-service setup --confirm --yes --output   ║                            
                            ║   json                                                       ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ [ yes, with sudo ]  [ enter cancel ]                         ║                            
                            ║ y yes, with sudo  n/esc/enter cancel                         ║                            
                            ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝                            
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
